<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink184-kilavi">
       vāyilvēṇṭivantār talaimakaṉ aṉpuṭaimai kūṟiyavaḻi vāyiṉmaṟukkuntalaimakaḷ colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        Spoken by the heroine who rejected mediation, when those who arrived desiring mediation spoke of the hero's love [for her].</p>
  </div>   
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink184">
<l>neyta liruṅkaḻi neyta ṉīkki</l>
<l>mīṉuṇ kurukiḷaṅ kāṉa lalkuṅ</l>
<l>kaṭalaṇin taṉṟava rūrē</l>
<l>kaṭaliṉum peritemak kavaruṭai naṭpē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The ocean, upon which the wader eats fish</l>
        <l>Having rejected the [one] Neytal flower in the dark backwaters [full of] Neytal, </l>
        <l>Rests in a young seashore grove,</l>
        <l>Adorned his town.</l>
        <l>For me, his friendship is bigger than [that] ocean.</l>
              </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
